<title>USA: Uno Restaurant sets 500,000-share buyback.</title>
<headline>Uno Restaurant sets 500,000-share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uno Restaurant Corp said Wednesday it would buy back up to 500,000 shares of its common.</p>
<p>The stock will be held in treasury and may be used from time to time for employee benefit plans, Uno said.</p>
<p>Uno operates 86 &quot;Pizzeria Uno..Chicago Bar &amp; Grill&quot; casual dining, full-service restaurants.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
</text>
